  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『九号』滑板车</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">九号滑板车通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现滑板车电量和续航查询。车机大屏/语音查询功能：电量显示、故障报警、查询- 续航显示、查询- 状态播报（续航、电量）。</span></p><div data-w-e-type=\"video\" data-w-e-is-void style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<video poster=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7372a95456874490aa3d97dbd2275b41.png?auth_key=1795677429-1f8b0e91f40d4c96998914fe0f05e043-0-0ee6d76be00c6f6e2ec943890096e7570b8be1f6a858d84ce42173996b05f3ed\" controls=\"true\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"width: 800px;height: auto;\"><source src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/0917be2350224eb98fef00c5284547b5.mp4?auth_key=1795677429-82055b0c898846e49590f6448c7085d6-0-273d63d4638272bfaa38c9d18bcd184d0730b4b4876abf592339ba7b3d37f676\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">视频 1-1 滑板车使用场景</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏上，滑板车相关的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">电量显示</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">续航显示</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">故障报警；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/2d4754b723c2433cbcc4a2c2b4912ef7.png?auth_key=1795677429-82ac86e564684e94a1247a72de2f28d1-0-9fbf1bc1bf3ead3d32766c1590a1101923c39900207e99c12e8f957e94c824e4\" alt=\"image.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 1-1 &nbsp;智慧物联App-设备详情</span></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 车机语音控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音和的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">查询 - 续航状态播报；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">查询 - 电量状态播报；</span></li></ul>"
}
